<title>USA: Bear Stearns readies $300 mln debt issue.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns readies $300 mln debt issue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns Cos Inc is expected to tap the corporate bond new issue market on its own behalf with a $300 million debt offering, syndicate sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a 10-year issue with price talk seen between 66-68 basis points over U.S. Treasuries, sources said.</p>
<p>The issue is expected to be priced on Monday or Tuesday, they added.</p>
<p>(( --Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
